                    {
                        "form_id": "e2bf0da5-f113-40f8-a682-ec296c801bef",
                        "entry_id": "29f192a0-7d5a-3470-b9a6-fa930b611485",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "технокра́тах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "78bc7100-6994-32a4-9e6d-c9c9f76abac5",
                        "entry_id": "29f192a0-7d5a-3470-b9a6-fa930b611485",
                        "glosses": [
                            "человек, получивший власть в силу своих профессиональных, научно-технических знаний; представитель технократии"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e340c722-4b5a-443c-8e84-dcab63cbc5d6",
                                "sense_id": "78bc7100-6994-32a4-9e6d-c9c9f76abac5",
                                "text": "Нет ли опасности, что при территориальных выборах на Съезде окажутся в основном технократы и политики и недостанет нравственного камертона в лице писателей, людей искусства?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0cbf2973-7794-4b5f-ae91-249dcfe3d815",
                                "sense_id": "78bc7100-6994-32a4-9e6d-c9c9f76abac5",
                                "text": "Возможно, это самая высокая оценка труда выдающегося и противоречивого ученого и политика, технократа и ― одновременно ― одного из последних романтиков науки, считавшего, что в XX веке именно в ученых воплотился дух пионеров, отодвигающих границы непознанного."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "21f751f7-d6e3-4572-99d3-99beedeb42ff",
                        "source_entry_id": "29f192a0-7d5a-3470-b9a6-fa930b611485",
                        "source_sense_id": "78bc7100-6994-32a4-9e6d-c9c9f76abac5",
                        "target_lang_word": "technocrat",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "technocrat",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7a4c45d-ef95-3ecd-a622-029bf377734f",
                                        "entry_id": "6b9185e7-570a-39bc-b0ac-70b3cbb5295f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An advocate of technocracy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f13841a-5621-3fc3-863b-fea821fcc2b9",
                                        "entry_id": "6b9185e7-570a-39bc-b0ac-70b3cbb5295f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An expert in some technology, especially one in a managerial or administrative role."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e92ebdd3-2286-4daa-a04e-b308561234cf",
                                                "sense_id": "1f13841a-5621-3fc3-863b-fea821fcc2b9",
                                                "text": "Another by now trusted technocrat, d'Aguesseau, returned as Chancellor, initiating down to his death in 1751 landmark judicial reforms."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe70fb9c-a9d7-4129-932f-05a043c78f6d",
                                                "sense_id": "1f13841a-5621-3fc3-863b-fea821fcc2b9",
                                                "text": "Would the site’s community of decentralized, uncompensated editors continue to govern it according to its principles of openness, transparency, and neutrality, or would a handful of highly paid NGO technocrats re-orient Wikipedia toward endorsing and promoting the ever-shifting currents of the Western elite social justice regime?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f42944b-e289-4f90-837f-b9980c7b4696",
                                                "sense_id": "1f13841a-5621-3fc3-863b-fea821fcc2b9",
                                                "text": "[Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney]’s been able to sell himself as a no-nonsense technocrat who knows how to steer a crisis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c94723fe-0cd7-3d23-a599-a67f67d982ab",
                                        "entry_id": "6b9185e7-570a-39bc-b0ac-70b3cbb5295f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who makes decisions based solely on technical information and not personal or public opinion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9a23fd0c-e56d-4765-89de-80aa85666ea2",
                        "source_entry_id": "29f192a0-7d5a-3470-b9a6-fa930b611485",
                        "source_sense_id": "78bc7100-6994-32a4-9e6d-c9c9f76abac5",
                        "target_lang_word": "tecnócrata",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tecnócrata",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d4636b5-51a1-3133-b18e-3a478ece0b64",
                                        "entry_id": "1b48f0a2-0db4-3ae1-9ff8-db6f6ac27af1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que pertenece o concierne a la tecnocracia."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6922ee12-483d-4adb-b670-2533c6aaf922",
                                                "sense_id": "4d4636b5-51a1-3133-b18e-3a478ece0b64",
                                                "text": "El presidente, lamentó un comunicado eclesiástico, hablaba de los detalles técnicos de la reforma de las jubilaciones y la Iglesia del \"sentir humano de los jubilados\". En definitiva, él era un cínico tecnócrata y ellos, amorosos pastores."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f50707cb-e99f-445d-8205-652438a6a2d2",
                        "source_entry_id": "29f192a0-7d5a-3470-b9a6-fa930b611485",
                        "source_sense_id": "78bc7100-6994-32a4-9e6d-c9c9f76abac5",
                        "target_lang_word": "tecnocrate",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tecnocrate",
